XIUP UP UPB VDD VSS inv_lv
XIDN DN DNB VDD VSS inv_lv
XLEGP IBP ICP UP UPB VOUT VDUMP VDD cp_leg_p
XLEGN IBN ICN DN DNB VOUT VDUMP VSS cp_leg_n
XBUF VOUT IBN VDUMP VDD VSS cp_dumpbuf
.ends

